## Change Button Text

You can also change the text of buttons using `nextBtnText`, `prevBtnText` and `doneBtnText` options.

Change Button Text

```
import { driver } from "driver.js";
import "driver.js/dist/driver.css";

const driverObj = driver({
  nextBtnText: '—›',
  prevBtnText: '‹—',
  doneBtnText: '✕',
  showProgress: true,
  steps: [
    // ...
  ]
});

driverObj.drive();
```

